SUMMARY:Meet New Friends in Toronto | Fast Friends & Board Games (25–45)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nLooking to make n
 ew friends in Toronto?\n\nMaking new friends as an adult isn't always easy
 —but it doesn't have to be awkward.\n\nJoin us for a fun\, hosted evenin
 g at Stout Irish Pub\, where you'll meet new people through our signature 
 Fast Friends conversation rounds. Most guests come on their own\, and our 
 friendly host Kruttika will make sure you feel welcome from the moment you
  arrive.\n\n🎲 Stay for Board Games!\nAfter you've met everyone\, keep t
 he conversations going over a selection of easy\, social board games. Whet
 her you play or simply chat over a drink\, it's a relaxed way to reconnect
  with the people you clicked with.\n\n🎟️ Book Early & Save - [https:/
 /toro15thaug.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toro15thaug.eventbrite.co.uk)\nYou 
 can pay securely with any debit or credit card through PayPal—no PayPal 
 account required.\n\nAdvance tickets are cheaper and help us create the be
 st group size and balance for great conversations.\nEarly Bird: CAD$10\nRe
 gular: CAD$15\nAt the Door: CAD$20 cash to your host.\n\nWhat to Expect\n
 🍻 7:00 PM – Welcome & Meet the Host\nArrive\, grab a drink\, and sett
 le in. Your host\, Kruttika\, will welcome you\, explain how the evening w
 orks\, and help you feel comfortable. If you're coming alone (like most gu
 ests)\, we'll make introductions before we begin.\n\n💬 7:30–8:30 PM 
 – Fast Friends\nMeet a new person every few minutes through a series of 
 fun\, relaxed conversations. No awkwardly approaching strangers—everyone
  gets the chance to connect.\n\n🎲 8:30 PM onwards – Board Games & Soc
 ialising\nStay for optional\, easy-to-learn board games or simply grab ano
 ther drink and continue chatting with the people you connected with. It's 
 the perfect way to turn first conversations into real friendships.\n\n✨ 
 Leave with More Than Just Conversations\n\nWhy You'll Love It\n✔ Meet 15
 –20 new people in one evening\n✔ Most guests attend solo\n✔ Friendly
  hosted introductions\n✔ Members from our 7 Toronto Meetup communities a
 ttend\n✔ Optional social board games after Fast Friends\n✔ Reserved ar
 ea at Stout Irish Pub\n\nWho Is This For?\n✔ Ages 25–45\n✔ New to To
 ronto or long-time locals\n✔ Solo attendees welcome\n✔ Anyone looking 
 to build genuine friendships and expand their social circle\nWe're not a c
 losed group—new faces are always welcome\, and you'll never feel like an
  outsider.\n\nWhy We Use Tickets\nYour ticket helps us:\n• Organise the 
 right venue space.\n• Support our local hosts.\n• Create a safer\, mor
 e committed group experience.\n• Deliver a well-organised evening for ev
 eryone.\n\nAbout Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been h
 elping people build meaningful friendships in 30+ cities around the world.
 \nOur mission is simple:\nTo make meeting new people easy\, relaxed\, and 
 enjoyable.
