SUMMARY:Meet New Friends in Toronto | Fast Friends: Find Your People Editi
 on (25–45)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nLooking to make n
 ew friends in Toronto?\n\nSkip the awkward small talk and join us for a fu
 n\, hosted evening at High Park Brewery. Most guests come solo\, and our f
 riendly host makes it easy to meet everyone through a series of relaxed on
 e-on-one conversations.\n\n✨ New this month: Find Your People! After mee
 ting everyone\, reconnect with people who share your interests—from trav
 el and fitness to books\, food\, hiking\, music and more.\nStay afterwards
  for drinks and continue the conversations naturally.\n\n🎉 Guests join 
 us from across seven Toronto Meetup communities\, so attendance is often h
 igher than the number of RSVPs shown on this page.\n\n🎟️ Book Early &
  Save - [https://toro22ndaug.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toro22ndaug.eventbr
 ite.co.uk)\nYou can pay securely with any debit or credit card through Pay
 Pal. A PayPal account is not required.\n\nAdvance tickets are cheaper and 
 help us create the best possible group size and balance.\n\nEarly Bird: CA
 D$10\nRegular Ticket: CAD$15\nAt the Door (Cash): CAD$20 (to your host)\n\
 nWhat to Expect\n7:00 PM – Welcome & Introductions\nMeet your host\, Kru
 ttika\, who'll welcome you and help everyone feel comfortable. If you're f
 eeling a little shy\, arrive early for some informal introductions.\n7:30
 –8:30 PM – Fast Friends\nMeet a new person every few minutes in a seri
 es of fun\, relaxed conversations.\nFrom 8:30 PM – Find Your People & So
 cialise\nReconnect with the people you clicked with\, discover shared inte
 rests and enjoy the rest of the evening over drinks.\n\nWhy You'll Love It
 \n✔ Meet 15–20 new people in one evening\n✔ Most guests attend solo\
 n✔ Friendly hosted introductions\n✔ Members from our 7 Toronto Meetup 
 communities attend\, giving you the chance to meet an even wider mix of pe
 ople\n✔ Relaxed\, welcoming atmosphere\n\nGood to Know\n• Most people 
 attend alone—you won't be the only one.\n• We have a reserved area exc
 lusively for our group.\n• Members from our other Toronto Meetup communi
 ties may also attend\, making for a diverse mix of guests.\n• This event
  is intended for ladies and gents aged 25–45. The age range is a guideli
 ne\, and you'll naturally gravitate towards people in a similar stage of l
 ife.\n• This is not a dating event. Our focus is helping people make gen
 uine friendships and meaningful social connections in a relaxed environmen
 t.\n\nAbout Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been bringi
 ng people together in 30+ cities worldwide\, helping thousands of people b
 uild lasting friendships and meaningful connections.\nCome solo. Leave wit
 h new friends.
